3. Specified Requirements

3.1 Functional Requirements

Requirements are stated in singular form per IEEE 29148 .

FR-1 Capture

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-1.1 The system shall capture audio in 16 kHz mono PCM format. Must Audio file inspection
FR-1.2 The system shall perform streaming ASR with latency ≤2 seconds. Must Timing test
FR-1.3 The system shall allow the user to attach screen text via share intent. Should UI test
FR-1.4 The system shall allow manual note entry during capture. Must UI test
FR-1.5 The system shall display a persistent foreground notification while recording. Must Notification inspection

FR-2 Indexing

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-2.1 The system shall embed captured text within 500 ms per paragraph. Must Timing benchmark
FR-2.2 The system shall embed image and video-frame content. Should Feature test
FR-2.3 The system shall store embeddings in the memory graph. Must Database inspection
FR-2.4 The system shall deduplicate near-identical chunks (cosine > 0.98). Should Dedup test
FR-2.5 The system shall support incremental indexing. Must Indexing test

FR-3 Search & Retrieval

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-3.1 The system shall accept natural-language queries. Must UI test
FR-3.2 The system shall return top-k results ranked by cosine similarity. Must Query test
FR-3.3 The system shall support time-range filters. Should Filter test
FR-3.4 The system shall return p95 query latency ≤300 ms for ≤1M chunks. Must Performance benchmark

FR-4 Generation

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-4.1 The system shall synthesize answers using a local LLM. Must Generation test
FR-4.2 The system shall cite source chunk IDs in every answer. Must Output inspection
FR-4.3 The system shall refuse to answer if confidence < threshold. Should Confidence test
FR-4.4 The system shall run LLM inference in a worker thread. Must Thread inspection

FR-5 MCP Bridge

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-5.1 The system shall connect to stdio MCP bridges. Should Connection test
FR-5.2 The system shall invoke swarm_query, zoe_run, glama_chat_completion. Should Tool call test
FR-5.3 The system shall log every tool call. Must Log inspection
FR-5.4 The system shall gate network tool calls behind explicit user toggle. Must Toggle test

FR-6 Consent & Governance

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-6.1 The system shall require affirmative consent before first recording. Must Consent flow test
FR-6.2 The system shall allow per-session consent revocation. Must Revocation test
FR-6.3 The system shall implement T0–T6 conformance tiers. Should Tier audit
FR-6.4 The system shall provide a panic wipe that deletes the memory graph. Must Wipe test

FR-7 Validation

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-7.1 The system shall include a reproducible evaluation harness. Must Harness run
FR-7.2 The system shall report a VISION accuracy marker. Should Marker output
FR-7.3 The system shall run 14-check guardrails before release. Should Guardrail output

FR-8 Agent-Assisted Build

ID Requirement Priority Verification
FR-8.1 The build environment shall install android/skills via android skills add --all. Must CI script check
FR-8.2 The system shall require device-ai skill for on-device inference work. Must Skill audit
FR-8.3 The system shall require security skill for Keystore and sandboxing. Must Skill audit
FR-8.4 The system shall require testing-setup skill for CI parity. Must Skill audit
FR-8.5 Generated code shall be reviewed against skill guidance before merge. Must PR checklist
FR-8.6 Skills shall be pinned by commit SHA in SKILLS.lock. Must Lock file inspection
FR-8.7 neural-harness shall score generated code against relevant SKILL.md. Should Score output
FR-8.8 The APK shall be built via Android CLI and agent plugin. Must Build log
