6. Why This SRS Makes the Build Easy

1. IEEE 29148 conformance. Every requirement is necessary, unambiguous, verifiable, feasible, and singular .
2. Grounding > guessing. Every FR maps to an android/skills skill.
3. Explicit resource constraints. RAM, APK size, battery, and thermal budgets are quantified and verifiable.
4. Code validation metrics. Accuracy, precision, recall, F1, ROC-AUC, MCC, and coverage are tracked .
5. Traceability closed. Requirements → design → code → test matrix is maintained.
6. Reproducibility. Pinned skills + deterministic make apk + stable APK hash